<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- One part, twelve complete one-beat (1/4 time) bars, each a single
     quarter note - measure 12 exists so digit-entry bar jump (C4, Ref 6)
     has a real multi-digit target to test against without needing the
     user-provided 'Long tune' score. Notes cycle C D E F G A B C5 D5 E5 F5
     G5, one per measure, purely so each measure is distinguishable. -->
